结论得到 K8s Event（事实 #1）、Pod 状态（事实 #2）以及等待原因 Metric（事实 #3）的三重印证。\n\n**未解决的疑问：**\n为何 `aiops-case-04/workload-input` Secret 中未包含预期的 `unavailable-key`。现有数据仅能证明 Key 不存在这一**现象**，但未能捕获 Secret 被修改、遗漏创建或密钥轮转等管理层面的**原因**（未知项：为何 `workload-input` Secret 中未包含预期的 `unavailable-key`）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 51.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2: 51.8s (Evidence 45.8s, RCA 5.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 82.739, "metrics": {"run_id": "d046296444cc46cc", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 82.74667239189148, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}],